@startuml
!theme plain
!pragma layout smetana
title 1. Order 주문 상태 (OrderStatus)
hide empty description

[*] --> ORDERED : POST /orders
ORDERED --> INVENTORY_REQUESTED : stock.check 발행
INVENTORY_REQUESTED --> INVENTORY_CONFIRMED : stock.deducted\nstock.bulk.deducted
INVENTORY_CONFIRMED --> PAYMENT_REQUESTED : payment.request 발행
PAYMENT_REQUESTED --> PAID : payment.succeeded
PAID --> SHIPPED : shipment.created
SHIPPED --> DELIVERED : shipment.completed
DELIVERED --> [*]

INVENTORY_REQUESTED -[#red]-> CANCELLED : 재고 부족\n(check.response / lacked / bulk.lacked)
PAYMENT_REQUESTED -[#red]-> CANCELLED : payment.failed
PAID -[#red]-> CANCELLED : shipment.failed
ORDERED -[#gray,dashed]-> CANCELLED
INVENTORY_CONFIRMED -[#gray,dashed]-> CANCELLED
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of CANCELLED
  최종 상태
  사유는 OrderSaga.failureReason 에 기록
  회색 점선 = 사용자 취소 (PAYMENT_REQUESTED 까지)
end note
@enduml
